Hi Soham,

Whether 40-52 meter location error makes sense for your data depends on the tracking devices and signal reception. For a small animal under canopy and brush, this could make sense. Otherwise you could enforce a stronger prior. Better would be to scrounge up or collect some calibration data and/or information on the error structure.

Best,
Chris

